  "label": "Deflecting Accountability",
  "description": "The act of shifting blame away from oneself or a specific individual to a group or system. This is the core rhetorical strategy of the meme, which uses the visual of a diverse group to imply that the failure was not due to one person but due to the group's collective actions or inactions.",
